Right now, Lighter and Hyperliquid are dominating the entire perp ecosystem.
But honestly, Extended, Vooi, Tradifi, Hibachi, Paradex, Reya, EdgeX  these are super cool platforms with low fees and serious potential.Some of them are still very early, so it will take time for the whales to notice.

But once the whales start entering these ecosystems, these platforms will stand toe-to-toe with Hyperliquid and Lighter.
The next wave of perp competition is going to be insane.

Many of these early DEXs have better UI, fresher designs, and modern matching engines.

Some of them are building hybrid orderbooks, intent-based execution, modular risk engines, and AI-assisted trading, which could give them a huge edge as liquidity grows.

The market is shifting from cex to multi-chain, low-fee, low-latency perp trading this is where these new players shine.

And early adoption here could be the equivalent of being early on Hyperliquid in 2023 or Lighter in 2024.

